{"version":1,"content":"<p>OpenAI於11月20日開始向部分用户推送ChatGPT移動應用的新版界面，旨在讓用户更快捷地訪問常用功能，並更容易發現ChatGPT中的各項能力。此次改版首先面向擁有Dots或符合創建Dots條件的ChatGPT Pro用户開放，同時也有少量符合條件的Plus用户將參與體驗。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587240.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:04:02.787135+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:40:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:57:14.389349+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:57:14.389349+00:00","content_hash":"2dbd879ba98846ab91be2921254d07409f5f58c01be04b28e7329ff564cb549b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}